 * wiring, the upgrade path, the hello deadline plumbing, and binary frames on
 * an actual WebSocket.
 *
 * The shared test setup registers happy-dom, whose browser-emulating fetch/
 * WebSocket can't reach real sockets — this file needs Bun's natives, so it
 * unregisters for its duration (bun test runs files sequentially) and
 * restores afterwards.
 */

